===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*bʰergʰ-}}
Derived from {{l|ru|оберега́ть}}, and then {{l|ru|бере́чь}}, ultimately from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*berťi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|о́берег|ann=y}}
* {{ru-IPA|обере́г|ann=y}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|о́берег|or|обере́г}}

# [[amulet]], [[charm]]
#: {{syn|ru|талисма́н|амуле́т}}

====Usage notes====
* Final syllable stress is much more common. First syllable stress is considered standard but is rare and unknown to many speakers.

